      "role": "user",
      "content": "Best Time to Buy and Sell Stock\n\nYou are given an array prices where prices[i] is the price of a stock on day i. Choose a single day to buy and a later day to sell to maximize profit. Return the maximum profit, or 0 if no profit is possible.\n\nExample: prices = [7,1,5,3,6,4] -> 5 (buy at 1, sell at 6).\nConstraints: 1 <= len(prices) <= 10^5.",
      "id": "m-1",
      "timestamp": "2026-03-09T13:09:31.635Z",
      "durationMs": 0
    },
